d `--config-file` options to pass in config JSON/TOML\nL783:   * Core: Allow `Config` in addition to `Path` for the `config` parameter of `KimiCLI.create`\nL784:   * Tool: Include diff display blocks in `WriteFile` and `StrReplaceFile` approvals/results\nL785:   * Wire: Add display blocks to approval requests (including diffs) with backward-compatible defaults\nL786:   * ACP: Show file diff previews in tool results and approval prompts\nL787:   * ACP: Connect to MCP servers managed by ACP clients\nL788:   * ACP: Run shell commands in ACP client terminal if supported\nL789:   * Lib: Add `KimiToolset.find` method to find tools by class or name\nL790:   * Lib: Add `ToolResultBuilder.display` method to append display blocks to tool results\nL791:   * MCP: Add `kimi mcp auth` and related subcommands to manage MCP authorization\nL792: ## 0.67 (2025-12-22)\nL793: \nL794:   * ACP: Advertise slash commands in single-session ACP mode (`kimi --acp`)\nL795:   * MCP: Add `mcp.client` config section to configure MCP tool call timeout and other future options\nL796:   * Core: Improve default system prompt and `ReadFile` tool\nL797:   * UI: Fix Ctrl-C not working in some rare cases\nL798: ## 0.66 (2025-12-19)\nL799:   * Lib: Provide `token_usage` and `message_id` in `StatusUpdate` Wire message\nL800:   * Lib: Add `KimiToolset.load_tools` method to load tools with dependency injection\nL801:   * Lib: Add `KimiToolset.load_mcp_tools` method to load MCP tools\nL802:   * Lib: Move `MCPTool` from `kimi_cli.tools.mcp` to `kimi_cli.soul.toolset`\nL803:   * Lib: Add `InvalidToolError`, `MCPConfigError` and `MCPRuntimeError`\nL804:   * Lib: Make the detailed Kimi Code CLI exception classes extend `ValueError` or `RuntimeError`\nL805:   * Lib: Allow passing validated `list[fastmcp.mcp_config.MCPConfig]` as `mcp_configs` for `KimiCLI.create` and `load_agent`\nL806:   * Lib: Fix exception raising for `KimiCLI.create`, `load_agent`, `KimiToolset.load_tools` and `KimiToolset.load_mcp_tools`\nL807:   * LLM: Add provider type `vertexai` to support Vertex AI\nL808:   * LLM: Rename Gemini Developer API provider type from `google_genai` to `gemini`\nL809:   * Config: Migrate config file from JSON to TOML\nL810:   * MCP: Connect to MCP servers in background and parallel to reduce startup time\nL811:   * MCP: Add `mcp-session-id` HTTP header when connecting to MCP servers\nL812:   * Lib: Split slash commands (prev \"meta commands\") into two groups: Shell-level and KimiSoul-level\nL813:   * Lib: Add `available_slash_commands` property to `Soul` protocol\nL814:   * ACP: Advertise slash commands `/init`, `/compact` and `/yolo` to ACP clients\nL815:   * SlashCmd: Add `/mcp` slash command to display MCP server and tool status\nL816: ## 0.65 (2025-12-16)\nL817: \nL818:   * Lib: Support creating named sessions via `Session.create(work_dir, session_id)`\nL819:   * CLI: Automatically create new session when specified session ID is not found\nL820:   * CLI: Delete empty sessions on exit and ignore sessions whose context file is empty when listing\nL821:   * UI: Improve session replaying\nL822:   * Lib: Add `model_config: LLMModel | None` and `provider_config: LLMProvider | None` properties to `LLM` class\nL823:   * MetaCmd: Add `/usage` meta command to show API usage for Kimi Code users\nL824: ## 0.64 (2025-12-15)\nL825: \nL826:   * UI: Fix UTF-16 surrogate characters input on Windows\nL827:   * Core: Add `/sessions` meta command to list existing sessions and switch to a selected one\nL828:   * CLI: Add `--session/-S` option to specify session ID to resume\nL829:   * MCP: Add `kimi mcp` subcommand group to manage global MCP config file `~/.kimi/mcp.json`\nL830: ## 0.63 (2025-12-12)\nL831:   * Tool: Fix `FetchURL` tool incorrect output when fetching via service fails\nL832:   * Tool: Use `bash` instead of `sh` in `Shell` tool for better compatibility\nL833:   * Tool: Fix `Grep` tool unicode decoding error on Windows\nL834:   * ACP: Support ACP session continuation (list/load sessions) with `kimi acp` subcommand\nL835:   * Lib: Add `Session.find` and `Session.list` static methods to find and list sessions\nL836:   * ACP: Update agent plans on the client side when `SetTodoList` tool is called\nL837:   * UI: Prevent normal messages starting with `/` from being treated as meta commands\nL838: ## 0.62 (2025-12-08)\nL839:   * ACP: Fix tool results (including Shell tool output) not being displayed in ACP clients like Zed\nL840:   * ACP: Fix compatibility with the latest version of Zed IDE (0.215.3)\nL841:   * Tool: Use PowerShell instead of CMD on Windows for better usability\nL842:   * Core: Fix startup crash when there is broken symbolic link in the working directory\nL843:   * Core: Add builtin `okabe` agent file with `SendDMail` tool enabled\nL844:   * CLI: Add `--agent` option to specify builtin agents like `default` and `okabe`\nL845:   * Core: Improve compaction logic to better preserve relevant information\nL846: ## 0.61 (2025-12-04)\nL847: \nL848:   * Lib: Fix logging when used as a library\nL849:   * Tool: Harden file path check to protect against shared-prefix escape\nL850:   * LLM: Improve compatibility with some third-party OpenAI Responses and Anthropic API providers\nL851: \nL852: ## 0.60 (2025-12-01)\nL853: \nL854:   * LLM: Fix interleaved thinking for Kimi and OpenAI-compatible providers\nL855: ## 0.59 (2025-11-28)\nL856:   * Core: Move context file location to `.kimi/sessions/{workdir_md5}/{session_id}/context.jsonl`\nL857:   * Lib: Move `WireMessage` type alias to `kimi_cli.wire.message`\nL858:   * Lib: Add `kimi_cli.wire.message.Request` type alias request messages (which currently only includes `ApprovalRequest`)\nL859:   * Lib: Add `kimi_cli.wire.message.is_event`, `is_request` and `is_wire_message` utility functions to check the type of wire messages\nL860:   * Lib: Add `kimi_cli.wire.serde` module for serialization and deserialization of wire messages\nL861:   * Lib: Change `StatusUpdate` Wire message to not using `kimi_cli.soul.StatusSnapshot`\nL862:   * Core: Record Wire messages to a JSONL file in session directory\nL863:   * Core: Introduce `TurnBegin` Wire message to mark the beginning of each agent turn\nL864:   * UI: Print user input again with a panel in shell mode\nL865:   * Lib: Add `Session.dir` property to get the session directory path\nL866:   * UI: Improve \"Approve for session\" experience when there are multiple parallel subagents\nL867:   * Wire: Reimplement Wire server mode (which is enabled with `--wire` option)\nL868:   * Lib: Rename `ShellApp` to `Shell`, `PrintApp` to `Print`, `ACPServer` to `ACP` and `WireServer` to `WireOverStdio` for better consistency\nL869:   * Lib: Rename `KimiCLI.run_shell_mode` to `run_shell`, `run_print_mode` to `run_print`, `run_acp_server` to `run_acp`, and `run_wire_server` to `run_wire_stdio` for better consistency\nL870:   * Lib: Add `KimiCLI.run` method to run a turn with given user input and yield Wire messages\nL871:   * Print: Fix stream-json print mode not flushing output properly\nL872:   * LLM: Improve compatibility with some OpenAI and Anthropic API providers\nL873:   * Core: Fix chat provider error after compaction when using Anthropic API\nL874: ## 0.58 (2025-11-21)\nL875: \nL876:   * Core: Fix field inheritance of agent spec files when using `extend`\nL877:   * Core: Support using MCP tools in subagents\nL878:   * Tool: Add `CreateSubagent` tool to create subagents dynamically (not enabled in default agent)\nL879:   * Tool: Use MoonshotFetch service in `FetchURL` tool for Kimi Code plan\nL880:   * Tool: Truncate Grep tool output to avoid exceeding token limit\nL881: ## 0.57 (2025-11-20)\nL882: \nL883:   * LLM: Fix Google GenAI provider when thinking toggle is not on\nL884:   * UI: Improve approval request wordings\nL885:   * Tool: Remove `PatchFile` tool\nL886:   * Tool: Rename `Bash`/`CMD` tool to `Shell` tool\nL887:   * Tool: Move `Task` tool to `kimi_cli.tools.multiagent` module\nL888: \nL889: ## 0.56 (2025-11-19)\nL890: \nL891:   * LLM: Add support for Google GenAI provider\nL892: ## 0.55 (2025-11-18)\nL893:   * Lib: Add `kimi_cli.app.enable_logging` function to enable logging when directly using `KimiCLI` class\nL894:   * Core: Fix relative path resolution in agent spec files\nL895:   * Core: Prevent from panic when LLM API connection failed\nL896:   * Tool: Optimize `FetchURL` tool for better content extraction\nL897:   * Tool: Increase MCP tool call timeout to 60 seconds\nL898:   * Tool: Provide better error message in `Glob` tool when pattern is `**`\nL899:   * ACP: Fix thinking content not displayed properly\nL900:   * UI: Minor UI improvements in shell mode\nL901: ## 0.54 (2025-11-13)\nL902: \nL903:   * Lib: Move `WireMessage` from `kimi_cli.wire.message` to `kimi_cli.wire`\nL904:   * Print: Fix `stream-json` output format missing the last assistant message\nL905:   * UI: Add warning when API key is overridden by `KIMI_API_KEY` environment variable\nL906:   * UI: Make a bell sound when there's an approval request\nL907:   * Core: Fix context compaction and clearing on Windows\nL908: ## 0.53 (2025-11-12)\nL909: \nL910:   * UI: Remove unnecessary trailing spaces in console output\nL911:   * Core: Throw error when there are unsupported message parts\nL912:   * MetaCmd: Add `/yolo` meta command to enable YOLO mode after startup\nL913:   * Tool: Add approval request for MCP tools\nL914:   * Tool: Disable `Think` tool in default agent\nL915:   * CLI: Restore thinking mode from last time when `--thinking` is not specified\nL916:   * CLI: Fix `/reload` not working in binary packed by PyInstaller\nL917: ## 0.52 (2025-11-10)\nL918: \nL919:   * CLI: Remove `--ui` option in favor of `--print`, `--acp`, and `--wire` flags (shell is still the default)\nL920:   * CLI: More intuitive session continuation behavior\nL921:   * Core: Add retry for LLM empty responses\nL922:   * Tool: Change `Bash` tool to `CMD` tool on Windows\nL923:   * UI: Fix completion after backspacing\nL924:   *