5-10-24)\nL1056: \nL1057: ### Fixed\nL1058: \nL1059:   * Fix update checking\nL1060: \nL1061: ## 0.36 (2025-10-24)\nL1062: ### Added\nL1063: \nL1064:   * Add `/debug` meta command to debug the context\nL1065:   * Add auto context compaction\nL1066:   * Add approval request mechanism\nL1067:   * Add `--yolo` option to automatically approve all actions\nL1068:   * Render markdown content for better readability\nL1069: \nL1070: ### Fixed\nL1071: \nL1072:   * Fix \"unknown error\" message when interrupting a meta command\nL1073: \nL1074: ## 0.35 (2025-10-22)\nL1075: ### Changed\nL1076: \nL1077:   * Minor UI improvements\nL1078:   * Auto download ripgrep if not found in the system\nL1079:   * Always approve tool calls in `--print` mode\nL1080:   * Add `/feedback` meta command\nL1081: \nL1082: ## 0.34 (2025-10-21)\nL1083: \nL1084: ### Added\nL1085: \nL1086:   * Add `/update` meta command to check for updates and auto-update in background\nL1087:   * Support running interactive shell commands in raw shell mode\nL1088:   * Add `/setup` meta command to setup LLM provider and model\nL1089:   * Add `/reload` meta command to reload configuration\nL1090: \nL1091: ## 0.33 (2025-10-18)\nL1092: ### Added\nL1093: \nL1094:   * Add `/version` meta command\nL1095:   * Add raw shell mode, which can be switched to by Ctrl-K\nL1096:   * Show shortcuts in bottom status line\nL1097: \nL1098: ### Fixed\nL1099: \nL1100:   * Fix logging redirection\nL1101:   * Merge duplicated input histories\nL1102: \nL1103: ## 0.32 (2025-10-16)\nL1104: \nL1105: ### Added\nL1106: \nL1107:   * Add bottom status line\nL1108:   * Support file path auto-completion (`@filepath`)\nL1109: \nL1110: ### Fixed\nL1111: \nL1112:   * Do not auto-complete meta command in the middle of user input\nL1113: \nL1114: ## 0.31 (2025-10-14)\nL1115: \nL1116: ### Fixed\nL1117: \nL1118:   * Fix step interrupting by Ctrl-C, for real\nL1119: ## 0.30 (2025-10-14)\nL1120: \nL1121: ### Added\nL1122: \nL1123:   * Add `/compact` meta command to allow manually compacting context\nL1124: \nL1125: ### Fixed\nL1126: \nL1127:   * Fix `/clear` meta command when context is empty\nL1128: \nL1129: ## 0.29 (2025-10-14)\nL1130: \nL1131: ### Added\nL1132: \nL1133:   * Support Enter key to accept completion in shell mode\nL1134:   * Remember user input history across sessions in shell mode\nL1135:   * Add `/reset` meta command as an alias for `/clear`\nL1136: \nL1137: ### Fixed\nL1138: \nL1139:   * Fix step interrupting by Ctrl-C\nL1140: \nL1141: ### Changed\nL1142: \nL1143:   * Disable `SendDMail` tool in Kimi Koder agent\nL1144: \nL1145: ## 0.28 (2025-10-13)\nL1146: ### Added\nL1147: \nL1148:   * Add `/init` meta command to analyze the codebase and generate an `AGENTS.md` file\nL1149:   * Add `/clear` meta command to clear the context\nL1150: \nL1151: ### Fixed\nL1152: \nL1153:   * Fix `ReadFile` output\nL1154: \nL1155: ## 0.27 (2025-10-11)\nL1156: \nL1157: ### Added\nL1158: \nL1159:   * Add `--mcp-config-file` and `--mcp-config` options to load MCP configs\nL1160: \nL1161: ### Changed\nL1162: \nL1163:   * Rename `--agent` option to `--agent-file`\nL1164: \nL1165: ## 0.26 (2025-10-11)\nL1166: \nL1167: ### Fixed\nL1168: \nL1169:   * Fix possible encoding error in `--output-format stream-json` mode\nL1170: \nL1171: ## 0.25 (2025-10-11)\nL1172: ### Changed\nL1173: \nL1174:   * Rename package name `ensoul` to `kimi-cli`\nL1175:   * Rename `ENSOUL_*` builtin system prompt arguments to `KIMI_*`\nL1176:   * Further decouple `App` with `Soul`\nL1177:   * Split `Soul` protocol and `KimiSoul` implementation for better modularity\nL1178: \nL1179: ## 0.24 (2025-10-10)\nL1180: \nL1181: ### Fixed\nL1182: \nL1183:   * Fix ACP `cancel` method\nL1184: \nL1185: ## 0.23 (2025-10-09)\nL1186: ### Added\nL1187: \nL1188:   * Add `extend` field to agent file to support agent file extension\nL1189:   * Add `exclude_tools` field to agent file to support excluding tools\nL1190:   * Add `subagents` field to agent file to support defining s